OL,3,AUS marks 25th anniversary of 9/11 with
OL,4,Atribute to victims of attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe other living US presidents - Bill
OL,7,FClinton, George W Bush, Barack Obama
OL,8,Fand Joe Biden - all attended the
OL,9,Fceremony in New York at the site of the
OL,10,FWorld Trade Center where about 2,700
OL,11,Fdied after hijackers crashed two planes
OL,12,Finto the Twin Towers
OL,14,FAnother plane crashed in a field in
OL,15,FPennsylvania - a memorial service is
OL,16,Ftaking place there to remember those
OL,17,Fwho died on board Flight 93 after
OL,18,Fpassengers tried to regain control of
OL,19,Fthe cockpit
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
