OL,3,ATragic death of woman who testified
OL,4,Aagainst father in notorious mafia
OL,5,Amurder of mother
OL,6,
OL,7,FThose close to Cosco recall her bravery
OL,8,Fin speaking out at her father's trial,
OL,9,Fbut also her tremendous struggle in the
OL,10,Fyears that followed.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
